  m_text: "Hi, welcome to my mesh-rendered interior game demo recreation based on
    \"LoZ: Ocarina of Time\".\n(The 3D assets were provided from one of my university
    courses, which was modified from <color=#FFFFFF><u><link=\"https://github.com/opengl-tutorials/ogl\">here</link></u></color>.)\nHere
    are some tips for you to explore around:\n1. Click and drag to interact with
    the camera!\n2. Scroll the wheel to see what will happen!\nHave fun with my work!\n                                                                 
    \u2014Z."
